WEBVTT

00:58.507 --> 01:02.237
Kyoto, 2027

01:03.277 --> 01:04.947
This is Kyoto

01:06.487 --> 01:10.157
In collaboration between
Keito University and Pluura

01:10.447 --> 01:14.157
It's a project to record the
city's history in details.

01:14.327 --> 01:16.867
Under development,
the Chronicle Kyoto.

01:19.167 --> 01:20.457
We can still catch it

01:20.467 --> 01:21.877
Hurry, hurry!

01:26.007 --> 01:27.087
Safe!

02:07.047 --> 02:09.637
HELLO WORLD

02:09.637 --> 02:11.927
HELLO WORLD

02:11.927 --> 02:15.567
HELLO WORLD

02:17.697 --> 02:18.517
Karaoke?

02:18.897 --> 02:20.897
Then, what about Kawaramachi?

02:21.387 --> 02:23.017
Hey, do you want to come too?

02:24.407 --> 02:24.937
Hey!

02:25.647 --> 02:27.817
Sorry, uhm...

02:28.317 --> 02:29.737
I'm Katagaki

02:29.817 --> 02:31.697
Ah, yes, yes, Katagaki-kun

02:32.037 --> 02:35.407
Today we'll be going to a
karaoke with the class

02:35.487 --> 02:37.077
Ah, ehm...

02:37.077 --> 02:40.417
Ah, if you have something
else to do, it's fine, sorry

02:40.497 --> 02:42.247
Uhm, no...

02:42.727 --> 02:43.627
Let's go!

02:43.877 --> 02:44.827
Waait!

02:44.857 --> 02:45.997
Slow...

02:45.997 --> 02:46.597
Sorry, sorry!

02:46.597 --> 02:47.277
Hurry up!

02:47.277 --> 02:48.487
Everyone's already there?

02:48.487 --> 02:50.927
Yeah, today, 30 of us

02:57.267 --> 03:00.037
[Decisiveness]

03:01.637 --> 03:04.647
Don't just worry about
everything! Decide quickly!

03:10.837 --> 03:12.737
Hey you! Which one do you want?

03:15.197 --> 03:16.407
A cinnamon twist, please

03:16.407 --> 03:17.537
Alrighty! A cinnamon twist!

03:19.037 --> 03:22.497
Don't care how others see
you! Speak out your thoughts!

03:23.077 --> 03:24.507
Do you want to choose Arts?

03:24.507 --> 03:25.587
I don't know...

03:25.587 --> 03:26.797
I'm bad at it...

03:26.997 --> 03:28.247
My seat...

03:28.377 --> 03:30.337
What about calligraphy?

03:30.337 --> 03:32.017
My handwriting is really bad.

03:34.137 --> 03:37.677
Don't let others decide for you!
Decide on your own!

03:38.427 --> 03:40.057
Next one is librarian!

03:40.177 --> 03:41.767
Who likes books?

03:44.727 --> 03:47.107
Katagaki?
Is it okay?

03:47.437 --> 03:48.897
Uhm...

03:51.027 --> 03:51.987
I'll do it.

03:52.097 --> 03:54.237
I see, so it's Katagaki.

03:54.237 --> 03:54.867
How to write his name?

03:55.247 --> 03:59.407
Well, like Kata...

04:00.157 --> 04:01.747
Now, a girl...

04:02.907 --> 04:04.327
Ichigyou, will you do it?

04:04.707 --> 04:06.667
It's okay, Katagaki-kun!

04:09.707 --> 04:12.217
[Believe in your intuition!]

04:12.297 --> 04:13.627
It wasn't helpful...

04:14.677 --> 04:16.047
Which class that girl is in?

04:16.047 --> 04:17.387
Like an idol...

04:17.387 --> 04:20.137
Huuh, are you from Higashinaka...

04:20.387 --> 04:22.177
I've also lived there.

04:22.727 --> 04:24.477
Then, it's the start of the committee

04:28.537 --> 04:30.477
[The Library Committee's jobs]

04:30.477 --> 04:32.647
Now, for the end,
everyone please come here

04:33.647 --> 04:36.357
For communication,
we have made a group on WIZ

04:41.367 --> 04:43.617
Kadenokouji-san, let's exchange numbers

04:44.537 --> 04:45.917
Oh, okay

04:46.327 --> 04:47.167
Uhm, me too

04:47.167 --> 04:49.127
Waa, in a same group!

04:49.127 --> 04:50.167
I did it!

04:50.207 --> 04:50.707
Me too!

04:50.707 --> 04:52.127
Thank you, Kadenokouji-san!

04:52.947 --> 04:55.587
Add yourselves as friends

04:55.587 --> 04:57.757
So you can reach others any time

04:57.807 --> 04:59.137
Alright everyone! Let's head home!

04:59.797 --> 05:01.057
Go then

05:01.057 --> 05:02.637
Let's grab our bags

05:06.787 --> 05:08.767
I... Ichigyou-san...

05:08.797 --> 05:10.437
Hm?

05:12.147 --> 05:15.147
Ehm... You are not in that group...

05:15.987 --> 05:19.527
Don't you... want to exchange numbers...

05:26.577 --> 05:27.867
She's opening WIZ?

05:34.257 --> 05:35.587
Uhm... Just the number is fine...

05:36.297 --> 05:38.337
It's in Profile under Settings...

05:45.927 --> 05:47.347
Here, if you want something

05:50.307 --> 05:51.107
An address?

06:14.707 --> 06:16.837
[Reading diary]

06:25.317 --> 06:30.097
Today, the library closes
at 4, due to maintenance

06:30.737 --> 06:34.597
In case you would like to
borrow a book, 10 minutes before...

06:34.897 --> 06:36.357
Do I read it at home...

06:42.067 --> 06:42.867
What's that...

06:54.997 --> 06:55.797
A crow?

07:04.137 --> 07:04.597
Huh?

07:05.437 --> 07:06.077
It's legs...

07:12.457 --> 07:13.027
Wa...

07:14.907 --> 07:15.437
Wait!

07:18.957 --> 07:21.027
Where's that bird going...

08:00.067 --> 08:00.777
What?

08:04.777 --> 08:05.487
Huh?

08:41.147 --> 08:42.687
I... got in?

08:47.867 --> 08:52.327
I did it!

08:53.747 --> 08:55.997
It was successful, yes, yes!

08:56.917 --> 08:58.667
But... Fushimi Inari?

09:00.287 --> 09:01.177
It's off

09:02.147 --> 09:03.697
Is the accuracy limited?

09:04.587 --> 09:06.927
Wait... Or the place has moved...

09:07.547 --> 09:09.347
Hey! What day is it today?

09:10.637 --> 09:11.467
Si... Sixt...

09:11.467 --> 09:12.807
Ah, he doesn't see me

09:15.557 --> 09:17.137
Katagaki Naomi?

09:18.807 --> 09:20.307
Please don't follow me!

09:20.307 --> 09:20.937
Wait!

09:23.317 --> 09:24.987
Hey! Why are you running?

09:42.917 --> 09:45.297
What was that guy...

09:45.717 --> 09:46.587
I see

09:48.797 --> 09:49.797
It's convenient

09:50.337 --> 09:51.887
What?

09:54.637 --> 09:57.517
3 months before it...
Perfect!

09:59.977 --> 10:03.837
I'll call the police!
Please don't follow... me?

10:11.487 --> 10:12.737
He doesn't see me

10:13.867 --> 10:16.197
What... the hell are you?

10:16.657 --> 10:18.827
So, I'll tell you

10:19.417 --> 10:20.917
What I am...

10:22.997 --> 10:27.507
Then, Katagaki Naomi...
What are you?

10:48.067 --> 10:50.277
Stop, stop, sto-

10:59.497 --> 11:00.457
So you came

11:01.117 --> 11:02.537
I had no choice

11:03.077 --> 11:05.707
Just come on...
You are free anyway

11:05.877 --> 11:08.917
Please don't decide for me,
I'm busy even thought it's Saturday

11:09.257 --> 11:10.797
200 books in a year?

11:14.397 --> 11:16.397
Center of Kyoto Prefecture's
History Records

11:19.017 --> 11:21.437
It was in 2020, 7 years ago

11:21.767 --> 11:25.017
That a collaboration project was started
thanks to the work of Pluura,

11:25.017 --> 11:27.627
Keito University and the Kyoto Prefecture.

11:28.277 --> 11:29.687
The Chronicle Kyoto

11:30.027 --> 11:33.577
That's Pluura's, the world's
biggest web service's job

11:33.737 --> 11:35.737
As all of you you already know

11:35.987 --> 11:41.287
Services like maps are
now essential parts of our lives.

11:41.867 --> 11:46.497
Compared to a normal 2D map,
a 3D map has more details

11:46.627 --> 11:53.377
In addition, we can go back in
time to check records of all ages

11:53.717 --> 11:56.427
That's what's the Chronicle Kyoto
project is about.

11:56.677 --> 11:58.847
At least that's what they say

11:59.967 --> 12:03.187
In order to be able to record the 
endless information of the city,

12:03.687 --> 12:05.807
You need a storage with huge space

12:06.187 --> 12:10.227
However, Pluura has a
quantum computer project

12:07.407 --> 12:08.857
Good morning everyone!

12:10.197 --> 12:12.967
You can do anything if you are well!

12:10.777 --> 12:15.157
It was made possible thanks to
Keito University's new theory

12:12.967 --> 12:15.117
Let's do our best today as well!

12:15.907 --> 12:18.237
Professor, there are
visitors today.

12:23.787 --> 12:28.957
The result of that innovation,
is a recorder with infinite capacity.

12:29.627 --> 12:32.297
This quantum storage
is the ALLTALE

12:35.587 --> 12:36.047
Let's go!

12:38.897 --> 12:39.387
Wa-

12:39.927 --> 12:40.807
Uhm, sorry...

12:40.807 --> 12:43.227
There's something...
I have to leave...

12:45.187 --> 12:47.307
We have no time.
The bus is here.

12:47.687 --> 12:48.857
Where are we going?

12:48.937 --> 12:50.187
Demachiyanagi

12:50.187 --> 12:51.147
Check the route

12:53.237 --> 12:54.567
Travel to Demachiyanagi

12:59.407 --> 13:04.497
So that's makes the
Chronicle Kyoto that much more detailed

13:04.787 --> 13:07.167
That's right,
but on a whole different level

13:07.827 --> 13:11.837
ALLTALE, the quantum storage...
has an infinite space

13:12.457 --> 13:13.837
I can't tell you how big it is...

13:14.337 --> 13:17.087
Hundred million, or
trillion records...

13:17.757 --> 13:19.797
I can't imagine further

13:24.977 --> 13:26.977
Run! Our time is tight!

13:29.937 --> 13:30.817
Did we make it?

13:34.187 --> 13:35.687
There's nothing

13:35.817 --> 13:36.647
Nothing?

13:37.567 --> 13:39.367
Nope, there is something

13:41.117 --> 13:42.827
The events remain in the records

13:52.287 --> 13:57.757
In 2020... the Chronicle Kyoto's
true purpose has been secretly started

13:58.547 --> 14:02.467
Kyoto's whole area is observed
with a large number of drones

14:03.137 --> 14:07.517
They are recording every
event in Kyoto to the ALLTALE

14:08.187 --> 14:10.307
Every... event?

14:10.477 --> 14:17.237
On 2027, April 17...
Katagaki Naomi who read
a book by the river...

14:17.697 --> 14:19.857
Was hit by a falling drone

14:20.567 --> 14:22.737
That's the recorded past

14:25.287 --> 14:25.827
Past?

14:26.287 --> 14:31.287
Yes, that is the recorded
past of Kyoto in the ALLTALE

14:31.957 --> 14:36.047
You are the recorded past's
Katagaki Naomi in the ALLTALE

14:36.957 --> 14:42.007
And I'm... accessing the
ALLTALE from the real world

14:44.557 --> 14:46.517
Katagaki Naomi,
from 10 years in the future

14:48.557 --> 14:51.147
Me... in 10 years?

14:51.727 --> 14:56.567
I know everything about you;
well, because you're me.

14:57.737 --> 14:59.447
I know, I know...

15:00.237 --> 15:01.817
That's why I came here

15:02.617 --> 15:03.487
You...

15:09.447 --> 15:10.727
want a girlfriend

15:12.367 --> 15:13.957
Not... particularly...

15:16.047 --> 15:19.877
Ah, that thing really fell
and hurt you, Naomi...

15:20.967 --> 15:22.837
I'll talk with the public office

15:23.337 --> 15:26.347
It's fine...
Thank you, Mom!

15:32.727 --> 15:34.357
I bought it...
That thing

15:34.857 --> 15:37.517
Are you... really
me from the future?

15:38.277 --> 15:39.487
Our heights are different?

15:41.147 --> 15:42.027
You'll start growing

15:42.947 --> 15:45.447
Well, I use this
avatar for access

15:46.077 --> 15:47.827
But I can change my
appearance

15:52.957 --> 15:57.667
If everything in this world
is recorded data... then what's real?

15:58.297 --> 16:02.047
Real... it doesn't make
sense telling me that

16:02.627 --> 16:06.097
This world is a perfect
copy of the real world

16:06.717 --> 16:09.467
Reality that,
data that...

16:09.467 --> 16:13.437
If we switched places,
you wouldn't be able to notice

16:13.847 --> 16:15.307
It's meaningless asking what's real...

16:15.647 --> 16:19.817
Saying it that way...
I have no choice but to accept it

16:20.567 --> 16:21.777
You are adapting quickly

16:22.067 --> 16:23.547
It's like something from Egan...

16:22.067 --> 16:23.547
TL Note: Greg Egan is an Australian science fiction writer

16:24.697 --> 16:26.527
But then...

16:27.277 --> 16:30.947
If that world is the same,
then why did you come here?

16:31.287 --> 16:33.457
I said it just now,
but I'll say it again!

16:35.867 --> 16:36.787
Ah, wa-

16:41.797 --> 16:45.507
To ease the pain of
your adolescent suffering

16:47.257 --> 16:51.137
In other words,
to get you a girlfriend

16:52.427 --> 16:53.597
Did you learn for class?

16:54.717 --> 16:55.417
Not much

16:58.117 --> 17:00.017
Kadenon, let's go back

17:00.817 --> 17:02.777
Then, see you at lunch

17:03.277 --> 17:03.817
Bye

17:03.817 --> 17:04.527
Bye

17:05.697 --> 17:07.107
There, there, pass!

17:07.277 --> 17:08.907
Stop it!

17:09.287 --> 17:09.907
Oops!

17:16.707 --> 17:18.417
I'm sorry...

17:25.087 --> 17:26.757
A cinnamon twist, please!

17:27.677 --> 17:29.747
But Yukawa-senpai is...

17:29.747 --> 17:30.297
Chair

17:32.807 --> 17:33.597
Okay...

17:39.427 --> 17:41.177
[Read only one book at once]

17:53.407 --> 17:55.277
That... wait!

18:00.667 --> 18:01.537
Why the toil-

18:14.307 --> 18:17.427
It would be weird if you
talked
alone outside

18:17.767 --> 18:18.977
Thank you for your concern

18:19.897 --> 18:21.397
So, did you check it?

18:21.607 --> 18:23.977
Yes, I saw, but...

18:25.477 --> 18:26.277
Is that true?

18:26.487 --> 18:26.987
That's right

18:27.317 --> 18:29.027
Three months from now

18:29.607 --> 18:31.527
You will start going out
with Ichigyou Ruri

18:33.407 --> 18:34.417
What's with that face...

18:34.417 --> 18:36.097
No, just...

18:36.577 --> 18:39.247
I feel like Ichigyou-san
isn't for me...

18:39.617 --> 18:40.367
Not for you?

18:40.707 --> 18:45.997
Uhm... My type is
more like cute girls...

18:46.917 --> 18:48.837
If I get close to her,
she will eat me alive...

18:48.917 --> 18:51.297
The lone wolf type og
girls are a bit...s

18:51.587 --> 18:53.387
Who did you just call not cute?

18:53.387 --> 18:55.217
No, I didn't say she's not cute!

18:55.347 --> 18:56.467
She's rather beautiful, but...

18:56.557 --> 18:57.887
Just definitely not a
cute-type...

18:57.887 --> 19:00.227
She is a cute-type!
Who did you watch?

19:00.307 --> 19:02.267
Haven't you just mistaken
her for someone else?

19:02.727 --> 19:04.267
Come, I'll show you

19:04.977 --> 19:05.977
To the library

19:05.977 --> 19:07.817
Remember, no talking!

19:09.397 --> 19:10.067
Wait...

19:15.117 --> 19:17.537
Look, that's Ichigyou-san,
right?

19:19.907 --> 19:22.827
We are in the same committee,
I can't be mistaken

19:35.347 --> 19:37.307
When we started going out...

19:37.647 --> 19:38.657
An accident happened...

19:39.597 --> 19:41.967
During the fireworks festival
that we went together to

19:41.967 --> 19:43.787
A lightning strike hit a tree

19:44.857 --> 19:46.437
Unfortunately it was next to her...

19:47.317 --> 19:49.477
And she hasn't opened her
eyes again after that

19:52.277 --> 19:55.197
My goal is to
tamper with that record

19:55.657 --> 19:56.367
Tamper?

19:57.077 --> 19:59.747
Rewrite the record three months
from now and prevent the accident

20:00.447 --> 20:02.057
If her presence remains

20:02.087 --> 20:05.707
It becomes the source of a reaction,
and the records surrounding her
will also be rewritten

20:06.747 --> 20:08.247
In this infinite area...

20:08.797 --> 20:11.797
A world will be recorded,
where Ichigyou Ruri is still alive

20:14.217 --> 20:16.547
And then, what's the meaning of it?

20:17.757 --> 20:20.177
Even if Ichigyou-san
lives in the recording...

20:20.467 --> 20:22.057
She won't return to
the real world

20:22.387 --> 20:23.887
Then, why?

20:27.647 --> 20:29.437
We really just started dating...

20:30.647 --> 20:32.277
We weren't able to
go anywhere...

20:33.147 --> 20:34.657
I don't even have memories of her

20:34.657 --> 20:36.097
Not even a single photo

20:37.487 --> 20:38.447
Just once more...

20:39.157 --> 20:41.497
I want her smiling face...

20:42.247 --> 20:45.247
I want that record...
I want that memory...

20:45.997 --> 20:47.917
Even if it's not real

20:48.627 --> 20:51.507
Even if it's not me

20:58.007 --> 20:59.177
I can't do anything

21:00.177 --> 21:03.637
I can't even touch this world
with my avatar

21:05.017 --> 21:06.017
I'm powerless

21:07.687 --> 21:10.397
Please, lend me your power

21:10.857 --> 21:12.577
But I...

21:15.947 --> 21:17.697
But I still don't know anything...

21:18.447 --> 21:20.237
I don't even know Ichigyou-san that well...

21:21.867 --> 21:25.117
I can't even imagine going out with her

21:26.787 --> 21:27.287
But...

21:29.667 --> 21:33.257
I think I would be happy
going out with a pretty girl

21:35.877 --> 21:38.507
And if I can prevent the
accident, I want to help too!

21:42.217 --> 21:42.887
Uhm...

21:44.137 --> 21:46.887
How should we call each other?

21:52.857 --> 21:54.777
You call me "Sensei"

21:56.647 --> 21:59.027
Just pretend it... It's a formality

22:01.197 --> 22:04.237
I will teach you all kinds of things,
since I'm your senpai from 10 years

22:04.577 --> 22:07.747
But... how can you help me?

22:08.617 --> 22:12.037
Really! I can't do anything!
You should know me...

22:12.337 --> 22:15.087
No, you are no longer powerless

22:15.917 --> 22:17.257
Because you have me...

22:18.337 --> 22:19.467
And this guy

22:38.237 --> 22:39.317
Naomi?

22:40.277 --> 22:40.987
I'm going!

22:48.117 --> 22:49.367
Picture it with your mind

22:51.207 --> 22:55.127
Imagine something real and simple

22:55.547 --> 22:58.257
A plastic, rubber, paper

23:00.127 --> 23:01.427
With all your heart

23:05.427 --> 23:05.927
Grab!

23:19.817 --> 23:20.357
I did it

23:21.277 --> 23:23.947
Good Design,
the God's Hand

23:24.737 --> 23:27.867
It has direct access to the
recorded world and the ALLTALE's data

23:28.117 --> 23:30.117
A device that reviews the world itself

23:31.207 --> 23:32.327
Water from air

23:33.707 --> 23:35.087
Gems from the soil

23:36.287 --> 23:37.707
Something from the nothing

23:39.507 --> 23:40.717
It's an illusion

23:42.007 --> 23:44.967
As an avatar, I have little
authority inside the ALLTALE

23:45.927 --> 23:48.637
But the Good Design 
has physical authority

23:49.267 --> 23:51.057
You can touch and interfere

23:51.977 --> 23:55.807
If you use that glove, the
illusion becomes reality

23:56.477 --> 23:59.027
So, I can do anything?

23:59.897 --> 24:03.447
In theory,
but there are many restrictions

24:03.947 --> 24:06.947
First of all, only the part that
you touch directly can be rewritten

24:07.867 --> 24:10.117
You can't create things far away

24:10.787 --> 24:13.287
Also, the processing speed
depends on the amount of information

24:13.867 --> 24:17.167
Thing like simple substances and
water are easy to make

24:17.957 --> 24:21.507
But complex things take time and
they are hard to imagine

24:22.257 --> 24:24.467
The living body is the hardest to make

24:26.337 --> 24:29.097
Which part of the human body
has the most information?

24:30.807 --> 24:31.307
Brain?

24:33.227 --> 24:35.397
The human mind is the
center of information density

24:35.807 --> 24:38.317
Even though it's called Good Design,
even it can't do it

24:38.607 --> 24:42.897
So in other words, you can't
rewrite a human's mind...

24:43.357 --> 24:46.697
Exactly!
So my job will be this

24:49.407 --> 24:50.407
April 20th

24:50.977 --> 24:54.367
I visited the Kita Library
to borrow some books. I went by bus.

24:55.117 --> 24:59.087
Today, due to some events,
we grew closer together.

24:59.787 --> 25:02.627
In another words,
if I follow Sensei's path

25:03.167 --> 25:05.047
Ichigyou-san will become my girlfriend?

25:05.927 --> 25:09.597
In that case... Wouldn't it be
the best if you just left me alone?

25:10.217 --> 25:13.677
The moment I met you, the
records have already started changing

25:14.127 --> 25:16.187
If I let you be, no one knows
what will happen then

25:16.917 --> 25:18.977
I need to guide you
from now on

25:21.017 --> 25:22.197
So, leave it to me

25:22.407 --> 25:24.527
Just do what it says

25:24.897 --> 25:26.577
This is the future diary,

25:26.597 --> 25:28.777
The Perfect Manual

25:29.387 --> 25:30.987
Then what should I do, Sensei!?

25:31.177 --> 25:33.187
Well, first of all, take your book out

25:35.207 --> 25:35.707
Open it!

25:36.367 --> 25:36.957
Drop it!

25:39.047 --> 25:40.307
So...

25:40.307 --> 25:40.877
Pick it up!

25:44.227 --> 25:45.337
Why would he-

25:45.457 --> 25:46.517
Ah!

26:04.967 --> 26:05.737
Nice!

26:06.017 --> 26:07.407
It isn't nice at all!

26:07.507 --> 26:09.447
She likes me even less now!

26:09.567 --> 26:11.257
How is that the Perfect Manual!?

26:11.407 --> 26:12.257
Don't worry

26:15.077 --> 26:16.447
This is a necessary step

26:17.157 --> 26:18.867
Ehm... Ichigyou-san...

26:20.947 --> 26:23.057
About yesterday... Sorry

26:23.907 --> 26:25.467
I picked this up 
at the bus stop

26:27.667 --> 26:28.617
I was looking for that

26:30.827 --> 26:33.047
Sorry for not listening to you

26:33.257 --> 26:34.927
No, it's my fault

26:35.037 --> 26:36.507
I should have explained

26:37.177 --> 26:38.137
Here

26:39.687 --> 26:40.897
Thank you very much

26:41.117 --> 26:41.727
Not at all

26:43.487 --> 26:44.487
[I return her book mark. We made up.]

26:58.247 --> 27:01.327
Just a little, I was able
to get closer to her

27:01.687 --> 27:02.597
Just a little

27:03.877 --> 27:05.077
Don't rush it

27:05.977 --> 27:07.507
Your love has just begun

27:07.507 --> 27:15.897
Go further, far away,
the love is still young

27:14.297 --> 27:17.277
[President]
[Everyone bring a rug for Monday's bookshelf
cleaning. Reply to me during the weekend]

27:15.897 --> 27:22.087
Even if the world is pointing
towards you from behind

27:22.307 --> 27:30.507
Go further, without hesitation,
into your own universe with her

27:30.677 --> 27:40.967
That hand, trembling in the pocket,
now just want to take you

27:36.947 --> 27:39.157
[Thank you for letting me know]

27:38.567 --> 27:45.637
I don't know the future,
so I can' lose sight

27:45.817 --> 27:51.977
Mysterious techniques
Your charming nature

27:52.057 --> 27:59.877
Even if the wind blows away my "I love you"

28:00.087 --> 28:11.737
Our hands while connected loosely,
I will never let go of them

28:07.637 --> 28:09.397
It's about time we go home

28:15.197 --> 28:16.447
Well, I'm going this way

28:18.947 --> 28:22.977
We were on the same bus...
Aren't we going in the same direction?

28:24.017 --> 28:25.237
Ehm, no,  that time...

28:25.707 --> 28:28.997
That time... That day
I was going to Kita Library!

28:29.377 --> 28:31.797
Because there was a
"Mystery Magazine" there

28:33.257 --> 28:34.047
Is that so?

28:40.627 --> 28:43.847
I go there and read
as well, every month.

28:55.137 --> 28:58.647
[Ichigyou-san asks about the bus ride the other day. Why don't you go there today? Suspicious. A good way to dodge the question. A book from the library?]

29:08.777 --> 29:09.497
That is...

29:16.817 --> 29:18.187
[Fireworks, playing with
fire is prohibited.]

29:23.307 --> 29:24.027
Sensei

29:25.497 --> 29:26.307
Sensei!

29:27.477 --> 29:28.827
Look at this!

29:29.087 --> 29:30.087
Isn't it great?

29:30.237 --> 29:31.477
Iron! it's iron!

29:33.437 --> 29:34.787
The density is good enough

29:35.167 --> 29:36.287
Foreign matters
aren't too bad either

29:37.747 --> 29:39.577
I secretly practiced during the night

29:40.017 --> 29:42.057
I can make iron,
isn't it impressive?

29:46.937 --> 29:47.997
Illusion

29:48.377 --> 29:49.877
You should have dealt with
it, without getting scared

29:50.247 --> 29:52.047
I can't deal with it,
it was too sudden!

29:52.087 --> 29:52.587
Can't?

29:53.247 --> 29:55.177
Will you say the same thing,
when time comes?

29:56.757 --> 29:59.217
You can try to change it,
but you can't avoid it

30:00.427 --> 30:01.847
Whatever happens

30:02.097 --> 30:04.097
You have to be able to
protect her!

30:04.637 --> 30:06.557
You have to be able
to do anything

30:07.187 --> 30:10.187
The "Good Design" grants
you enough power for it

30:10.857 --> 30:12.147
The rest is up to you

30:15.237 --> 30:17.147
Imagination is the
most important thing

30:17.487 --> 30:19.987
Realize that you can
create, like an iron, in an instant

30:21.867 --> 30:24.657
Make your imagination
fly like as you are in a tale

30:25.247 --> 30:27.157
Believe that anything is possible!

30:31.327 --> 30:32.997
Rule everything!

30:34.417 --> 30:34.957
Cold!

30:35.247 --> 30:35.777
Hot

30:36.837 --> 30:37.917
Ouch!

30:48.807 --> 30:49.477
How's that?

30:50.177 --> 30:51.057
Copper

30:52.107 --> 30:53.397
There's a long
way ahead of us

30:54.067 --> 30:55.017
Sorry

30:55.777 --> 30:57.857
Ah! The time! I have to go!

30:58.527 --> 30:59.297
Hey, wait!

30:59.907 --> 31:00.407
It's today!

31:29.177 --> 31:31.187
It was too high for me...

31:34.147 --> 31:36.107
We all have shortcomings

31:38.317 --> 31:40.447
Next time I'll do the
upper bookshelf

31:41.857 --> 31:43.867
Then, I'll do the lower-

31:44.567 --> 31:47.367
The large books are there,
I'll do that too!

31:47.787 --> 31:49.157
Then, in the middle-

31:50.457 --> 31:51.497
Let it be

31:53.497 --> 31:54.287
Let's eat!

31:54.627 --> 31:59.917
Splitting the bookshelf into
upper, middle and lower part
was always inefficient

32:00.757 --> 32:04.387
However, because of that
we started talking more

32:13.647 --> 32:15.477
There was one
turning point

32:19.067 --> 32:21.027
Ouch, stop!

32:21.277 --> 32:22.397
What are you grinning for?

32:22.647 --> 32:24.237
I'm not grinning

32:24.947 --> 32:25.697
I'm glad

32:26.317 --> 32:28.197
It's thanks to your
note, Sensei!

32:28.867 --> 32:30.037
What should I do next?

32:30.747 --> 32:33.407
Just continue how you are now,
and everything will be fine

32:33.747 --> 32:35.707
As long as we have
information of the future

32:36.037 --> 32:39.067
You and Ruri are guaranteed
to be a couple

32:46.557 --> 32:49.587
June 25
Charity Book Fair

32:46.717 --> 32:50.927
Our biggest event, the
Secondhand Book Fair

32:51.427 --> 32:52.137
Who knows it?

32:54.267 --> 32:56.347
Okay... I expect similar interest...

32:57.357 --> 33:00.187
From today, we will collect used books,
and sell them on that day

33:01.187 --> 33:02.737
We also need an assistant

33:02.737 --> 33:05.697
And the assistant usually
wears cute clothes

33:05.947 --> 33:06.947
The shop assistant...

33:07.197 --> 33:09.697
Kadenokouji-san in a
shop assistant cosplay?

33:09.907 --> 33:10.947
Would you do it, Ruri?

33:10.947 --> 33:11.827
I won't

33:12.037 --> 33:14.497
And I told you to not call me that

33:14.827 --> 33:16.077
Then...
Ruurii

33:16.077 --> 33:16.957
I hate it

33:17.207 --> 33:17.747
Ruririinu

33:17.747 --> 33:19.007
No way. You aren't one to give up...

33:19.007 --> 33:22.917
The Secondhand Book Fair in June
will be an important event for us

33:23.417 --> 33:25.127
Do your best to collect books

33:25.297 --> 33:26.127
I understand!

33:27.267 --> 33:27.757
Gold!

33:32.577 --> 33:32.947
Slow

33:37.187 --> 33:40.107
But although it's collecting...

33:40.607 --> 33:43.187
We've also put Offer Boxes
in the classrooms

33:43.607 --> 33:45.777
Thank you for your help

33:47.697 --> 33:49.197
[Secondhand Book Fair Offer Box]

33:50.737 --> 33:53.537
The president told us too
that we shouldn't expect much

33:53.827 --> 33:57.827
We've decided to collect, so
we can't just give up now

33:58.537 --> 33:59.417
Let's do this!

34:06.427 --> 34:08.457
[Three days left]
[Collected books: 37]

34:09.887 --> 34:11.677
It doesn't need to be just collecting

34:12.057 --> 34:13.597
If you find one at home, donate it

34:13.927 --> 34:15.267
See ya

34:18.897 --> 34:20.017
Should we do it?

34:26.567 --> 34:27.277
This way

34:33.787 --> 34:36.037
My late grandfather read
and collected these books

34:36.577 --> 34:39.207
I don't think there's anything expensive

34:40.037 --> 34:41.287
Amazing!

34:42.707 --> 34:44.417
Let's offer some books
from here

34:44.917 --> 34:48.297
I was wondering if it's okay
for someone to have so much

34:48.967 --> 34:52.547
We decided to do it,
so we need to do anything we can

34:53.217 --> 34:55.467
But is it okay?
Your grandfather's-

34:56.417 --> 34:58.037
It's an important book
for you, right?

34:59.137 --> 35:02.897
Obviously, I feel regret, that
they will be someone else's

35:03.397 --> 35:07.277
My grandfather wasn't someone
who would have been angry

35:08.067 --> 35:11.157
It's a book's desire
to be read

35:12.817 --> 35:15.117
Then, how will we carry them?

35:18.407 --> 35:21.037
Let's carry them!

35:21.117 --> 35:25.337
The delivery service would
have cost money too...

35:31.927 --> 35:34.637
What kinds of books do you like,
Katagaki-san?

35:35.297 --> 35:36.717
Uhm...

35:37.387 --> 35:39.427
That's bad... I don't
know the answer...

35:40.387 --> 35:43.307
I... read almost anything

35:43.797 --> 35:45.817
It's a shallow and wide feeling

35:46.187 --> 35:47.107
Is that so?

35:51.647 --> 35:54.657
I like adventure novels

35:55.577 --> 35:57.867
Not giving up, even in hard times

35:58.487 --> 36:01.117
I admire those who fight
until the very end

36:03.417 --> 36:04.827
I want to live like that too

36:05.277 --> 36:06.997
I think I want to be
like that

36:14.137 --> 36:14.677
I...

36:16.227 --> 36:16.927
I...

36:21.267 --> 36:22.637
I like sci-fi books

36:24.147 --> 36:28.147
Sci-fi can show you
wonderful new world

36:29.107 --> 36:33.237
But they aren't just fairy tales...
They are extensions to our normal lives

36:34.107 --> 36:38.027
They make me feel like
I'm part of a tale as well...

36:40.787 --> 36:43.917
In the real world,
I'm just an extra

36:45.537 --> 36:48.627
That's why I can't explain at all

36:49.797 --> 36:53.337
But I like sci-fi

36:56.007 --> 36:56.887
Is that so

36:58.637 --> 36:59.677
That feeling...

37:03.637 --> 37:05.847
I think I understand it too

37:14.537 --> 37:16.607
[The City at the Bottom of the Great Lake]

37:16.817 --> 37:19.657
That book... Can I read it a bit?

37:20.197 --> 37:21.237
Do you want to take it?

37:22.447 --> 37:23.907
No, I'll buy it in the Fair

37:27.207 --> 37:28.457
Is that... a loan card?

37:29.747 --> 37:33.417
I think it's a book that was
given away by a library

37:34.127 --> 37:35.127
That's nice

37:35.757 --> 37:38.967
If you are the first one who reads it,
and write you name on the top...

37:39.387 --> 37:41.347
I think it must be a really good feeling

37:46.597 --> 37:48.977
Ruurii, what happened?

38:06.387 --> 38:08.167
Should we carry it to the library?

38:08.587 --> 38:10.337
We need permission from
the teacher...

38:09.577 --> 38:10.917
Ruurii, sorry

38:11.587 --> 38:13.797
You've done so much by yourself

38:14.707 --> 38:17.297
Please stop...
They weren't in use

38:18.377 --> 38:20.507
But thank you, Ruurii

38:20.927 --> 38:22.177
So...

38:45.157 --> 38:46.547
There was this light

38:46.857 --> 38:47.847
Hey, let's go

38:48.287 --> 38:51.287
I'm glad it didn't spread
to the school building

38:51.667 --> 38:54.457
If I knew it...
Could I have prevented it?

38:54.957 --> 38:56.627
That would have
changed the record

38:57.507 --> 38:59.427
The fire was one of the
necessary steps

39:03.007 --> 39:04.657
The Secondhand Book Fair
was cancelled

39:05.677 --> 39:09.227
She was depressed, and
I gave her comfort

39:09.977 --> 39:12.477
As a result, it
brought us closer

39:13.267 --> 39:14.187
You must do the same

39:38.417 --> 39:39.257
Idiot...

39:52.267 --> 39:53.267
It's no good

39:58.727 --> 40:00.857
But... but!

40:09.907 --> 40:10.537
Is that...

40:15.077 --> 40:15.707
Sensei...

40:19.627 --> 40:20.797
Thank you very much!

41:07.547 --> 41:09.007
Uhm... Ichigyou-san...

41:11.097 --> 41:12.557
Good morning!

41:17.517 --> 41:20.767
One box was placed elsewhere

41:21.777 --> 41:26.697
Even thought it's not even 50...
The Fair can be held now

41:29.117 --> 41:29.657
This...

41:30.637 --> 41:35.067
[The City at the Bottom of the Great Lake]

41:38.077 --> 41:38.827
Ichigyou-san...

41:40.537 --> 41:42.627
I'm glad that book is safe

41:45.547 --> 41:46.337
Katagaki-san

41:58.267 --> 41:59.997
Ruurii, Katagaki-kun!

42:00.377 --> 42:01.317
Can it be...

42:03.687 --> 42:04.567
That box...

42:09.567 --> 42:11.467
It wasn't just us...

42:11.827 --> 42:14.287
I brought all volume of that
demon love series!

42:16.407 --> 42:19.667
But, grandmother,
what big eyes you have?

42:20.207 --> 42:22.377
Read books from the
Secondhand Book Fair

42:22.377 --> 42:23.627
Can I take a photo?

42:23.627 --> 42:24.917
Yes, you can~

42:26.587 --> 42:29.547
Why do you just
sit here, Ruurii?

42:29.547 --> 42:30.677
Wait- Wait!

42:37.517 --> 42:38.097
Huh...

42:39.977 --> 42:40.807
The Secondhand Book Fair!

42:40.937 --> 42:42.147
You didn't wake up

42:43.147 --> 42:44.607
You were really tired

42:47.487 --> 42:48.027
What?

42:49.027 --> 42:49.527
No...

42:51.617 --> 42:53.577
Because we tried our best
to sell many books...

42:54.117 --> 42:55.037
We did it

42:58.537 --> 43:00.117
Then, uhm...

43:00.207 --> 43:01.257
[Donation Amount: ¥34850]
[SOLD OUT!!]

43:04.847 --> 43:05.627
Yay!

43:05.957 --> 43:06.707
Katagaki-san...

43:08.627 --> 43:09.927
Thank you very much

43:10.467 --> 43:13.097
No, uhm, I haven't done...

43:16.097 --> 43:17.427
Thank you very much

43:21.657 --> 43:24.317
[The City at the Bottom of the Great Lake]
[Ichigyou Ruri]

43:24.477 --> 43:26.977
Uhm... I...

43:27.607 --> 43:28.237
I...

43:32.657 --> 43:33.737
Ichigyou-san...

43:35.037 --> 43:35.847
I like you

43:43.497 --> 43:44.417
Is that so?

43:52.217 --> 43:55.887
Dating is something
you can't do alone

43:57.467 --> 44:02.307
So... let's try it
together, shall we?

44:09.477 --> 44:12.407
T... tha... that book...

44:12.407 --> 44:14.387
That you wanted to read,
Katagaki-san...

44:14.817 --> 44:16.117
I put it aside for you

44:23.207 --> 44:23.997
Almost there

44:30.127 --> 44:31.597
Unleash you imagination!

44:31.847 --> 44:33.377
Be reckless!

44:33.377 --> 44:33.837
Yes!

44:34.227 --> 44:36.547
More! You can
do anything!

44:36.847 --> 44:38.757
You can do anything
if you accept it!

44:38.967 --> 44:41.137
This of the world as yours!

44:41.597 --> 44:42.557
And then become...

44:46.247 --> 44:47.297
The God of this World!

44:56.947 --> 44:57.987
You pass

45:00.647 --> 45:03.487
[ July, 3 (Saturday) ]
[Ujigawa Fireworks Festival]

45:09.587 --> 45:12.257
That day, we went to
see the fireworks

45:13.587 --> 45:15.587
The lightning strike's
was 20:01

45:17.047 --> 45:18.927
But I made sure not to invite her

45:20.007 --> 45:22.977
There aren't even rain clouds here...
Can we avoid it?

45:23.477 --> 45:24.637
If there's nothing

45:25.637 --> 45:27.187
And what if...
something happens

45:40.077 --> 45:41.487
What... is that?

45:42.367 --> 45:43.407
Did they come?

45:44.577 --> 45:46.037
The Homeostatic System

45:46.747 --> 45:49.707
It watches over the
ALLTALE's system files

45:49.997 --> 45:51.877
And trying to fix them
back to the normal state

45:52.877 --> 45:54.257
W... what should I do?

45:54.547 --> 45:56.257
Design!
Bring out your weapon!

46:09.727 --> 46:10.767
I could interfere

46:11.517 --> 46:12.057
Yes!

46:19.867 --> 46:22.277
Protect her until the time of the accident!

46:22.657 --> 46:23.577
Let's keep it up until then

46:24.237 --> 46:25.157
And then...

46:25.287 --> 46:27.537
I'll tell you then! Now go!

46:27.577 --> 46:27.827
Yes!

46:31.207 --> 46:31.787
Behind you!

46:34.167 --> 46:34.707
Right!

46:35.407 --> 46:36.377
30 degrees to left!

46:38.427 --> 46:38.967
Inside!

46:55.317 --> 46:55.857
No way!

46:56.777 --> 46:57.277
Hurry!

47:14.797 --> 47:15.497
Is this...

47:17.167 --> 47:19.087
I messed with the system privileges

47:21.967 --> 47:24.297
Naomi! That's the place
of the lightning strike!

47:24.637 --> 47:25.387
Ichigyou-san

47:25.807 --> 47:26.267
Uhm...

47:27.137 --> 47:27.807
Ouch!

47:29.347 --> 47:30.057
My leg...

47:33.227 --> 47:34.187
Damn it!

47:36.817 --> 47:37.567
2 more minutes!

47:38.397 --> 47:39.027
Naomi!

47:39.487 --> 47:40.237
Sensei...

47:42.107 --> 47:44.697
This is the end...
It ends here!

47:45.237 --> 47:46.827
Don't worry about anything now!

47:47.997 --> 47:48.867
Be flashy!

47:53.897 --> 47:54.497
Yes!

48:01.427 --> 48:02.337
1 more minute!

48:18.277 --> 48:19.857
Don't stop!
Keep building it!

48:28.657 --> 48:29.617
10 seconds!

48:37.837 --> 48:39.757
You can do it

49:28.677 --> 49:29.637
I... did it...

49:30.597 --> 49:31.307
Yes!

49:43.277 --> 49:44.187
Katagaki-san?

49:51.327 --> 49:52.347
Ichigyou-san!

49:52.347 --> 49:53.387
You are saved!

49:53.907 --> 49:55.787
Yes! I did it!

49:56.327 --> 49:57.327
I'm so glad

49:58.497 --> 50:00.167
I'm glad... I did it!

50:04.917 --> 50:05.627
Sorry!

50:47.217 --> 50:48.547
What is going on?

50:49.047 --> 50:51.217
Katagaki-san, Katagaki-san!

50:51.427 --> 50:53.887
It was necessary to unite
the body with the soul

50:54.967 --> 50:58.137
There's a gap between the physical
cranial nerve and the quantum mind

50:58.137 --> 50:59.917
I have to get rid of it

51:00.687 --> 51:04.937
I had to bring the mind's state
as close to the accident as possible

51:05.527 --> 51:06.227
Sensei?

51:07.067 --> 51:09.397
At last, the measured value has
exceeded the threshold

51:10.157 --> 51:12.527
Now she can be
synchronized

51:13.277 --> 51:14.527
What are you talking about?

51:15.287 --> 51:15.827
Uhm...

51:18.907 --> 51:20.417
Please let Ichigyou-san out

51:20.667 --> 51:22.037
She fell in love

51:23.707 --> 51:25.497
Fell in love with you

51:25.957 --> 51:27.957
And now her mind...

51:28.297 --> 51:31.047
Is almost in the same state
as when the accident happened

51:31.677 --> 51:35.007
Now... everything is ready

51:43.647 --> 51:46.017
She didn't die after
the lightning strike

51:48.777 --> 51:50.237
She's brain dead

51:52.947 --> 51:53.907
Katagaki-san!

51:55.657 --> 51:57.787
Stop it!

52:01.077 --> 52:01.667
Thank you

52:02.997 --> 52:05.037
Good bye, Naomi

53:02.637 --> 53:03.727
I missed you

53:09.147 --> 53:11.477
Katagaki... san?

53:31.337 --> 53:33.877
What was that thing, flying
and moving around?

53:46.137 --> 53:46.687
Come out...

53:48.307 --> 53:49.027
Come out!

53:52.107 --> 53:55.357
Airplane, car or even with a bicycle

53:55.737 --> 53:57.837
Elevator?
Stairs?

53:57.837 --> 53:58.927
Anything!

53:59.317 --> 54:00.907
I don't care just come out!

54:01.487 --> 54:02.537
Just get out!

54:08.377 --> 54:10.627
There are no sequelae so far

54:11.247 --> 54:14.627
But regaining consciousness
from such a state...

54:15.717 --> 54:16.927
It's a miracle

54:18.387 --> 54:20.637
If we can use the quantum
data of the ALLTALE

54:21.387 --> 54:23.967
A damaged brain
can recover

54:24.927 --> 54:27.807
But the data was moved

54:29.767 --> 54:31.357
The other side of her
is no longer there

54:35.487 --> 54:37.857
Maybe in the house...

54:47.247 --> 54:48.287
What's that...

54:50.957 --> 54:56.177
[Large portion of data is corrupted here.]
[This area cannot be used.]

54:56.177 --> 54:57.007
Open it!

54:57.507 --> 54:59.297
Let Ichigyou-san out!

55:00.087 --> 55:01.177
Ichigyou-san!

55:32.497 --> 55:35.047
Let's increase the joule for the
automatic record repair!

55:35.047 --> 55:36.247
It's already at limit

55:36.457 --> 55:37.757
Senko-san! Shuu-san!

55:37.957 --> 55:39.167
Naomi!

55:39.547 --> 55:41.717
A part of the records got damaged

55:41.927 --> 55:43.717
The cause is yet to be identified

55:44.217 --> 55:44.967
Any idea?

55:45.307 --> 55:47.767
I don't know the cause...

55:47.767 --> 55:48.887
But we have bigger problems

55:49.347 --> 55:53.357
The damaged part is
altering other records as well

55:53.937 --> 55:56.937
If it continues like that, the
butterfly effect will exceed the threshold

55:56.977 --> 55:59.737
If the ALLTALE
produces more failure...

56:00.487 --> 56:02.587
It will be a chain collapse

56:03.237 --> 56:03.817
What should we do?

56:05.487 --> 56:07.367
It means Recovery

56:07.367 --> 56:08.157
Recovery?

56:08.497 --> 56:09.577
Oh, no...
[in Chinese]

56:10.707 --> 56:12.917
Turn off the damaged
data and take it out

56:13.117 --> 56:14.627
The repair comes after that

56:15.667 --> 56:18.087
It's a big task.
Should we do it right away?

56:18.507 --> 56:19.047
Yes!

56:19.707 --> 56:20.417
I'll change clothes

56:41.737 --> 56:42.447
Why...

56:44.487 --> 56:45.777
Why would this...

56:50.787 --> 56:53.497
So it's a goodbye to that
poor guy?

57:27.677 --> 57:29.717
[Seiko Laboratory]
[Seiko Tsunehisa]

57:39.947 --> 57:41.827
[Akiyoshi Jun - Daruman Gourmet]
[Katagaki Naomi - Newcomer!]

58:00.207 --> 58:01.937
[Head of System Management]
[same in Chinese]

58:39.907 --> 58:42.347
[Spinal cord injury]

59:38.957 --> 59:40.457
We're ready for Recovery

59:41.577 --> 59:42.997
It can't be helped, huh

01:00:17.077 --> 01:00:17.737
Recovery

01:00:18.647 --> 01:00:22.567
Partially erase the ALLTALE's
data and restarts after it

01:00:23.997 --> 01:00:25.997
Do you want to free up that space?

01:00:26.627 --> 01:00:28.087
Then, let's start it

01:01:19.887 --> 01:01:20.467
This town...

01:01:21.557 --> 01:01:22.427
The world...

01:01:22.927 --> 01:01:23.657
Is being erased?

01:01:26.687 --> 01:01:27.477
Am I...

01:01:28.977 --> 01:01:33.277
You are the recorded past's
Katagaki Naomi in the ALLTALE

01:01:34.777 --> 01:01:35.407
Am I...

01:01:36.357 --> 01:01:39.447
Recorded world,
the ALLTALE'S data

01:01:41.337 --> 01:01:44.037
Am I going to die?

01:01:56.547 --> 01:01:57.587
Ichigyou-san

01:02:10.187 --> 01:02:12.187
Maybe...
Somewhere...

01:02:15.697 --> 01:02:18.197
No, it's not good!
I can't be sure that she's saved!

01:02:35.127 --> 01:02:37.337
Just do what it says

01:02:40.297 --> 01:02:41.597
The future is written down

01:02:43.347 --> 01:02:45.217
According to the
Perfect Manual

01:02:51.297 --> 01:02:52.987
[The Fair was a great success]
[I'm really happy Ichigyou-san was laughing]

01:04:07.887 --> 01:04:10.637
I... died?

01:04:44.507 --> 01:04:45.757
Katagaki Naomi-san

01:04:46.927 --> 01:04:49.017
Can you... talk?

01:04:49.637 --> 01:04:50.567
I can talk

01:04:51.187 --> 01:04:54.107
So, I'm here to answer your questions

01:04:54.727 --> 01:04:56.267
You are not dead

01:05:06.277 --> 01:05:08.027
I'm your ally

01:05:09.657 --> 01:05:10.407
Ally?

01:05:10.697 --> 01:05:12.657
Katagaki Naomi-san

01:05:12.657 --> 01:05:15.877
You are going to being back
Ichigyou Ruri with your own hands

01:05:16.947 --> 01:05:17.837
Ok [in Chinese]

01:05:17.957 --> 01:05:19.747
It's automatic from here

01:05:19.997 --> 01:05:22.297
It's scheduled to finish
in 80 hours

01:05:22.547 --> 01:05:24.467
And the restoration
is 1000 the time of that

01:05:26.837 --> 01:05:30.427
The source was around the
Homeostatic System

01:05:31.057 --> 01:05:34.097
It's in control of the ALLTALE's 
huge amount of information...

01:05:34.597 --> 01:05:36.397
The load is nothing like before...

01:05:36.767 --> 01:05:38.647
It's like a dam wall

01:05:41.977 --> 01:05:45.447
Shouldn't we run the maintenance
once again before we put the data back?

01:05:45.817 --> 01:05:46.737
Hey, Naomi!

01:05:47.027 --> 01:05:47.567
Where's him?

01:05:48.157 --> 01:05:49.697
Katagaki-san
is at the hospital

01:05:50.197 --> 01:05:52.907
Ahh, his love...

01:05:53.577 --> 01:05:54.707
Ah,that's relieving to hear

01:05:55.037 --> 01:05:56.577
When her consciousness is back...

01:05:56.927 --> 01:05:58.497
That will be really good

01:05:59.037 --> 01:06:01.417
Ah, that's right!

01:06:03.257 --> 01:06:05.797
Bring back Ichigyou-san?

01:06:06.177 --> 01:06:07.797
The world is distorted

01:06:08.677 --> 01:06:11.847
The Homeostatic System
is for fixing distortions

01:06:12.137 --> 01:06:14.637
It tries to erase Ichigyou Ruri

01:06:15.347 --> 01:06:19.517
Even if you say that,
I have no power

01:06:19.977 --> 01:06:22.897
No, you have power

01:06:23.607 --> 01:06:27.357
Your power that you
earned through hard work

01:06:36.867 --> 01:06:37.957
What are you...

01:06:38.457 --> 01:06:42.917
I'm the one who watched
you through these three months

01:06:43.377 --> 01:06:44.547
An ordinary Crow

01:06:50.337 --> 01:06:51.637
Katagaki Naomi-san

01:06:52.507 --> 01:06:54.307
Would you like a girlfriend?

01:07:02.227 --> 01:07:02.697
Yes!

01:07:19.247 --> 01:07:20.117
10 years?

01:07:21.997 --> 01:07:24.917
You've been in a coma ever since
that lightning strike accident

01:07:25.247 --> 01:07:26.977
It's a miracle that you woke up

01:07:27.917 --> 01:07:30.717
During these 10 years,
I've had accidents too

01:07:31.547 --> 01:07:33.507
Many many things have happened

01:07:36.677 --> 01:07:39.767
But I'm glad I didn't give up

01:07:46.317 --> 01:07:47.437
I've met you again

01:07:55.617 --> 01:07:56.227
Do you remember?

01:07:56.987 --> 01:07:58.997
That day...
The fireworks

01:08:00.537 --> 01:08:01.037
Here

01:08:07.047 --> 01:08:09.717
I've been...
I've been waiting...

01:08:20.977 --> 01:08:21.727
That book...

01:08:23.397 --> 01:08:24.017
That book?

01:08:27.297 --> 01:08:28.067
It's not like that

01:08:30.107 --> 01:08:32.397
You aren't Katagaki-san

01:08:41.787 --> 01:08:42.747
What's that...

01:08:48.587 --> 01:08:49.207
No way

01:08:52.507 --> 01:08:53.547
No way that we are too...

01:08:54.507 --> 01:08:56.137
In a recorded world?

01:09:18.737 --> 01:09:19.117
Stop!

01:09:21.447 --> 01:09:22.657
The goal of the system...

01:09:23.787 --> 01:09:24.917
Is to eliminate
foreign objects

01:09:27.627 --> 01:09:30.597
Stop! Get out right now! Hey!

01:09:32.007 --> 01:09:33.877
Stop!!

01:09:43.097 --> 01:09:43.767
That was...

01:09:59.487 --> 01:10:00.577
Katagaki-san?

01:10:01.617 --> 01:10:02.327
Ichigyou-san

01:10:08.037 --> 01:10:09.837
Is that you...
Naomi?

01:10:11.047 --> 01:10:11.627
Idiot...

01:10:12.627 --> 01:10:14.627
Such an idiot...

01:10:20.387 --> 01:10:21.467
Katagaki-san...

01:10:21.597 --> 01:10:24.807
These guards...
Are aiming for you, Ichigyou-san

01:10:24.977 --> 01:10:25.597
For me?

01:10:26.017 --> 01:10:26.807
But it's okay

01:10:28.227 --> 01:10:29.557
I'll do something

01:10:36.197 --> 01:10:37.277
Can you get off, please?

01:10:58.967 --> 01:11:01.427
Let's go back...
To our place

01:11:18.697 --> 01:11:20.717
Naomi, it's serious!

01:11:21.067 --> 01:11:22.987
I have no idea
what's goin' on!

01:11:22.987 --> 01:11:23.867
The internal area?

01:11:24.077 --> 01:11:26.027
The quantum record bit
got into a loop

01:11:26.367 --> 01:11:28.597
The retained information
is just keep increasing

01:11:29.027 --> 01:11:29.777
Almost! [in Chinese]

01:11:30.037 --> 01:11:31.707
The logical boundary is breaking down!

01:11:31.997 --> 01:11:32.627
Did you hear?

01:11:32.877 --> 01:11:35.087
Anyways, come back
immediately, Naomi!

01:11:45.847 --> 01:11:46.717
Slow

01:11:51.727 --> 01:11:52.727
They'll catch up!

01:11:53.187 --> 01:11:53.767
Then...

01:12:00.987 --> 01:12:01.777
Amazing!

01:12:14.247 --> 01:12:15.497
How far should I go?

01:12:15.707 --> 01:12:17.337
Please go in a straight line

01:12:17.877 --> 01:12:19.667
Distance 1.9km

01:12:20.167 --> 01:12:20.837
There...

01:12:21.127 --> 01:12:21.837
There it is

01:12:23.137 --> 01:12:27.767
That's the most suitable spot for
Ichigyou Ruri's re-transfer to ALLTALE

01:12:28.557 --> 01:12:30.517
The Grand Stairway at Kyoto Station

01:12:36.227 --> 01:12:37.617
Do you want a ride?

01:12:38.007 --> 01:12:39.517
Car, bike

01:12:39.527 --> 01:12:40.777
I can't drive!

01:12:40.897 --> 01:12:41.607
Bicycle

01:12:41.817 --> 01:12:42.397
Want!

01:12:45.237 --> 01:12:45.987
Like this...

01:12:50.617 --> 01:12:53.287
The area influenced by ALLTALE
seems to increase

01:12:53.667 --> 01:12:57.487
Within the affected area,
they can occur from anywhere

01:13:32.957 --> 01:13:34.577
Ichigyou-san,
close your eyes

01:13:35.327 --> 01:13:36.457
Don't leave me

01:14:37.187 --> 01:14:38.097
I can't make in time

01:14:38.897 --> 01:14:39.517
You can!

01:14:51.867 --> 01:14:53.577
Get in!
Hurry up!

01:15:01.747 --> 01:15:02.667
Please get out of here!

01:15:10.757 --> 01:15:11.427
Why...

01:15:12.887 --> 01:15:14.807
Return her to your
original world

01:15:16.267 --> 01:15:18.267
It's all my fault

01:15:19.187 --> 01:15:19.727
I...

01:15:22.157 --> 01:15:25.667
I just wanted to see
her smile once again

01:15:38.207 --> 01:15:39.287
To make amends

01:15:41.077 --> 01:15:42.247
Tell me what to do, Naomi!

01:15:45.127 --> 01:15:47.167
Kyoto Station!
To The Grand Stairway

01:15:49.297 --> 01:15:50.877
It's still the Homeostatic System

01:15:52.427 --> 01:15:54.847
They are recklessly trying to
halt the information increase

01:15:55.177 --> 01:15:56.267
Emergency?

01:15:56.427 --> 01:15:57.457
Impossible

01:15:57.807 --> 01:15:59.827
The only way now
is to stop it directly

01:16:00.557 --> 01:16:02.977
To stop directly?

01:16:06.567 --> 01:16:07.277
Up!

01:16:08.357 --> 01:16:10.527
Naomi! The road! Make uphill!

01:16:10.567 --> 01:16:11.067
Yes!

01:16:19.407 --> 01:16:20.407
Hey, are you stupid?

01:16:20.647 --> 01:16:21.167
Focus!

01:16:21.167 --> 01:16:23.537
Ichigyou-san, don't worry,
it will be fine!

01:16:33.347 --> 01:16:33.927
We arrived

01:16:34.347 --> 01:16:35.177
Getting ready

01:16:35.927 --> 01:16:36.747
Your hand

01:16:58.037 --> 01:16:58.737
Converter

01:17:02.867 --> 01:17:04.167
It's on the
while staircase

01:17:04.417 --> 01:17:08.127
The quantum conversion will
finish when you reach the last step

01:17:10.707 --> 01:17:13.467
The System is
approaching this location

01:17:13.677 --> 01:17:14.377
We need to hurry!

01:17:14.717 --> 01:17:17.007
First, Ichigyou Ruri's
conversion...

01:17:17.677 --> 01:17:18.717
Can you go down?

01:17:19.287 --> 01:17:19.887
Your leg...

01:17:20.307 --> 01:17:21.057
What is...

01:17:22.117 --> 01:17:22.717
But...

01:17:27.147 --> 01:17:27.857
Ichigyou-san

01:17:29.977 --> 01:17:30.777
It's okay!

01:17:31.357 --> 01:17:32.187
Let's do this!

01:17:36.487 --> 01:17:37.367
Let's go!

01:17:37.777 --> 01:17:40.117
Then, please follow me

01:17:40.907 --> 01:17:41.407
Okay!

01:17:49.497 --> 01:17:50.667
Hey, hurry!

01:17:53.127 --> 01:17:53.547
What's wrong?

01:17:55.467 --> 01:18:01.607
Are you...
Katagaki-san, right?

01:17:58.967 --> 01:18:01.597


01:18:10.147 --> 01:18:11.777
I'm just an ordinary extra

01:18:13.937 --> 01:18:14.437
Then...

01:18:18.487 --> 01:18:21.987
You...
loved me, right?

01:18:27.327 --> 01:18:28.667
Thank you very much

01:18:31.417 --> 01:18:32.047
Farewell

01:18:51.267 --> 01:18:52.067
Ichigyou-san...

01:18:58.547 --> 01:18:59.157
I...

01:19:08.117 --> 01:19:09.537
I liked you

01:19:17.507 --> 01:19:18.047
You did it!

01:19:19.377 --> 01:19:19.927
Kataga-

01:19:22.137 --> 01:19:22.967
Katagaki-san?

01:19:29.977 --> 01:19:32.057
Hurry up, Naomi!
you are the next one!

01:19:42.777 --> 01:19:44.527
Crap, crap!

01:19:53.127 --> 01:19:54.167
Oh no...

01:19:54.877 --> 01:19:55.457
Naomi!

01:19:57.667 --> 01:19:58.717
Knock it down, Naomi!

01:19:58.967 --> 01:19:59.927
But how...

01:20:02.137 --> 01:20:03.177
Make something huge

01:20:11.477 --> 01:20:13.147
An axis!
Then a jet!

01:20:20.737 --> 01:20:21.817
Punch it out!

01:20:32.707 --> 01:20:34.127
Can you restore the stairs?

01:20:34.657 --> 01:20:38.177
Many pieces are broken...
It will take some time

01:20:53.557 --> 01:20:54.437
Have to be kidding me

01:20:56.267 --> 01:20:58.817
Professor,
are you sure it's okay?

01:20:59.357 --> 01:21:01.647
If you stop the Homeostatic System...

01:21:02.067 --> 01:21:04.567
The information will
infinitely increase inside the ALLTALE

01:21:04.817 --> 01:21:06.297
Now repeat it
in Japanese

01:21:07.117 --> 01:21:08.617
It's called The Genesis

01:21:09.787 --> 01:21:10.827
Genesis?

01:21:11.117 --> 01:21:14.677
The creation of a new world,
The Big Bang

01:21:50.787 --> 01:21:52.077
Sensei, go!

01:22:20.437 --> 01:22:21.317
That thing...

01:22:23.687 --> 01:22:24.817
It's risky

01:22:25.237 --> 01:22:27.067
The target is too big

01:22:27.387 --> 01:22:28.067
It will just spread
even more

01:22:29.617 --> 01:22:30.447
I see...

01:22:31.077 --> 01:22:32.447
Then, what should I do?

01:22:45.587 --> 01:22:46.167
Naomi

01:22:46.967 --> 01:22:47.877
Sensei...

01:22:48.547 --> 01:22:50.177
There's a way to beat that

01:22:51.047 --> 01:22:54.177
Ah... really?
Please tell me what to do

01:22:54.557 --> 01:22:56.057
This time use the
Good Design...

01:22:58.017 --> 01:22:58.897
To erase me...

01:22:59.517 --> 01:23:01.977
Huh... Why?

01:23:03.567 --> 01:23:06.067
I don't have to explain

01:23:06.567 --> 01:23:09.027
But, but that...

01:23:09.197 --> 01:23:09.987
There's no other way

01:23:10.447 --> 01:23:14.237
But... but even then, there's no
guarantee that this thing will disappear

01:23:14.617 --> 01:23:16.537
The System tried to erase her

01:23:17.247 --> 01:23:20.037
Instead of bringing her back,
it tried to erase her

01:23:20.627 --> 01:23:23.037
That solves the address duplication

01:23:23.587 --> 01:23:25.917
The ALLTALE's mind
and this world's body

01:23:26.507 --> 01:23:30.837
The fox guards wanted to
get rid of that duplication

01:23:31.427 --> 01:23:33.217
In other words...
If you or me...

01:23:33.887 --> 01:23:37.637
Disappears from this word,
It will stop

01:23:38.937 --> 01:23:40.937
It would be a disaster
if you were gone

01:23:41.807 --> 01:23:43.307
It's already decided

01:23:44.687 --> 01:23:45.357
No!

01:23:50.357 --> 01:23:53.737
No! Absolutely no!

01:24:00.747 --> 01:24:03.377
It's okay!
We can still make it!

01:24:03.917 --> 01:24:05.417
I'll be done with this right away!

01:24:10.797 --> 01:24:11.377
Naomi!

01:24:11.967 --> 01:24:15.597
I'll create that converter
once again!

01:24:24.857 --> 01:24:25.607
No...

01:24:27.437 --> 01:24:28.277
No!

01:24:44.577 --> 01:24:48.157
Hello, my dear

01:24:48.917 --> 01:24:55.207
I agree, fate is absurd

01:24:52.087 --> 01:24:53.127
No...

01:24:55.637 --> 01:24:58.967
As Sensei said...
If I believe in it...

01:24:58.677 --> 01:25:02.797
Hello, my dear

01:24:59.927 --> 01:25:01.477
That I can really do anything

01:25:03.137 --> 01:25:03.977
No!

01:25:03.957 --> 01:25:10.487
No matter if you are in pain,
The world will laugh

01:25:04.647 --> 01:25:06.147
We're both going to live!

01:25:40.007 --> 01:25:40.767
Yup

01:25:42.347 --> 01:25:45.807
You can do anything
if you believe in it

01:25:47.147 --> 01:25:49.647
Sensei...

01:25:52.397 --> 01:25:53.317
Sensei...

01:26:02.117 --> 01:26:03.367
Katagaki Naomi

01:26:06.577 --> 01:26:07.787
Be happy

01:26:30.727 --> 01:26:33.067
She was the first person I chose

01:26:34.567 --> 01:26:38.487
The day I lost Ichigyou-san,
I lost my future

01:26:39.317 --> 01:26:43.487
I decided to get her back,
whatever it takes

01:26:44.617 --> 01:26:47.747
I decided to get back our future

01:26:49.747 --> 01:26:50.377
Our...

01:27:19.157 --> 01:27:22.737
I'm... happy

01:29:19.687 --> 01:29:20.317
Ichigyou-san

01:29:24.607 --> 01:29:25.527
Katagaki-san

01:29:27.277 --> 01:29:28.277
Katagaki-san...

01:29:29.617 --> 01:29:30.697
Katagaki-san...

01:29:52.057 --> 01:29:52.727
Thank you

01:29:57.767 --> 01:30:00.567
Where should we go...

01:30:00.857 --> 01:30:02.687
It's a new universe, isn't it?

01:30:04.817 --> 01:30:06.857
I don't know how it is

01:30:07.487 --> 01:30:10.617
I hope it will be
easier to live there

01:30:16.327 --> 01:30:17.207
Katagaki-san

01:30:18.287 --> 01:30:23.627
Did we... come back to
our original world?

01:30:28.797 --> 01:30:29.797
Surely, we did

01:30:38.767 --> 01:30:42.277
It's a new world that
no one knows about

01:30:54.997 --> 01:31:03.707
HELLO WORLD
Credits: Marshall ~ AnimeKayo
Special Thanks for the Subs to Hina (@LnlyHikikomori)

01:31:15.877 --> 01:31:16.687
Yes!

01:31:16.687 --> 01:31:18.417
It was successful!
Finally he's awake!

01:31:18.417 --> 01:31:19.237
I'm so glad

01:31:19.237 --> 01:31:22.107
The body soul and the body
needs to be synced

01:31:23.107 --> 01:31:26.147
It was because of someone special to you

01:31:27.737 --> 01:31:32.367
At last, your mind
is synced to your body

01:31:42.957 --> 01:31:44.087
You finally did it

01:31:45.507 --> 01:31:46.587
Katagaki-san

01:31:51.727 --> 01:31:54.177
Ichigyou...

01:32:24.537 --> 01:32:27.957
HELLO WORLD

01:32:27.957 --> 01:32:33.297
I hope you enjoyed the movie ^^

01:32:33.297 --> 01:32:38.517
Encoded By : Marshall ~ AnimeKayo

01:32:38.517 --> 01:32:42.097
Subtitle Credits:
Translated by:
Hina (@LnlyHikikomori)
Helped with subtitle:
Buzzle (@OHaiiBuzzle) 
Helped: Pillow (@MyBodyPillow)
Proofreader: Eskimo, Igneous Fragor

01:32:42.097 --> 01:32:55.157
The air looks thinner than usual,
as if it was fake

01:32:55.777 --> 01:33:02.917
My sick heart always gets wet
under the never stopping rain

01:33:02.917 --> 01:33:10.797
I never have an umbrella with me,
What am I trying to do that anxious?

01:33:24.607 --> 01:33:37.827
I want to hurry back to you,
but the time we promised has already passed

01:33:38.457 --> 01:33:45.597
I wish I could fly out,
do whatever I want, to scatter around

01:33:45.597 --> 01:33:51.157
But I feel like I can't change

01:33:54.227 --> 01:33:58.047
Well they keep on tellin’ me

01:33:59.607 --> 01:34:05.557
At least let me love you

01:34:06.187 --> 01:34:07.607
However

01:34:07.977 --> 01:34:19.517
I want to love, but I can't
I don't want to endure it every day

01:34:20.417 --> 01:34:21.517
Just do it

01:34:22.027 --> 01:34:29.017
It doesn't matter how many times,
It doesn't matter how many times
I turn the pages of my notebook

01:34:29.087 --> 01:34:38.007
Let's start over in fresh place
In our new world

01:34:38.007 --> 01:34:50.357
Some day I will reach you too,
I'll keep this wish

01:35:04.327 --> 01:35:10.997
I'm just walking brave like an idiot
While I don't even have a cape

01:35:11.247 --> 01:35:18.087
You laughed out loud,
But suddenly that's all I needed

01:35:19.827 --> 01:35:23.467
When the sky comes fallin’ down

01:35:24.997 --> 01:35:31.607
From a deep, long hole

01:35:31.767 --> 01:35:40.277
I want to touch your love
But it all changed

01:35:40.357 --> 01:35:47.307
Why I can't go back anymore?

01:35:47.307 --> 01:35:54.397
Why am I relived, why am I not crying?

01:35:54.447 --> 01:36:01.727
Laugh and hug each other, even now

01:36:01.727 --> 01:36:13.617
I want to meet you,
I want to meet you,
Talk even without voice

01:36:14.227 --> 01:36:15.727
I love you

01:36:15.727 --> 01:36:22.887
I don't care how many times,
I don't care how many times
It's not perfect, give us a bouquet of flowers

01:36:22.887 --> 01:36:29.787
Fill up the whole world with that scent

01:36:29.787 --> 01:36:37.087
The stars painting the sky with different colours,
never leaving the night sky black

01:36:37.087 --> 01:36:45.927
Light up to break,
Reapint it to pure white once again

01:36:45.927 --> 01:36:58.737
In that new world,
Let's hold hands every day

01:37:12.807 --> 01:37:19.087
Doesn't matter how many times,
Doesn't matter how many times

01:37:19.087 --> 01:37:27.057
Always, my hand
And your hand
